{
  "_comment": [
    "Host settings fragment for the careful guardrail (Claude Code). Do not copy it by hand:",
    "`python3 factory/bin/adopt.py --register-guard` merges the hooks below into",
    ".claude/settings.json, keeps every other key, and drops this comment.",
    "",
    "BOTH matchers are required and they do different jobs:",
    "  Bash|PowerShell                   the destructive-command matcher. PowerShell is the",
    "                                    primary shell on Windows; a Bash-only matcher never",
    "                                    fires there.",
    "  Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit refuses edits to the guard's own files.",
    "Registering only the first leaves the guard deletable by one edit nothing watches.",
    "",
    "The command FAILS CLOSED: if check-careful.sh is missing, cannot run, or prints anything",
    "but a JSON object, it exits 2, which Claude Code treats as a block, and says so on stderr.",
    "A plain `bash <missing file>` exits 127, a non-blocking error, and `bash <empty file>`",
    "exits 0 with no output, which is no decision: either way the tool call would proceed.",
    "The shim prints a JSON object on every path it can take, so the check costs nothing.",
    "The command is run by `sh -c` on macOS and Linux and by Git Bash on Windows. Native",
    "Windows WITHOUT Git Bash runs hooks in PowerShell, where this command cannot run and the",
    "guard is absent: see harness/HARNESS.md section 7 and skills/careful/SKILL.md.",
    "",
    "Adapt .claude/hooks/careful.json BEFORE registering. Then run the live probes in",
    "skills/careful/SKILL.md: a green test table is not evidence the host enforces anything."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|PowerShell",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "out=$(bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/check-careful.sh\") && case \"$out\" in \"{\"*) printf '%s\\n' \"$out\" ;; *) false ;; esac || { echo \"[careful] BLOCKED: the guard in .claude/hooks/ did not run or printed no decision (check-careful.sh missing, empty or broken). Restore .claude/hooks/ before anything else.\" >&2; exit 2; }",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "careful: checking for a destructive command"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "out=$(bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/check-careful.sh\") && case \"$out\" in \"{\"*) printf '%s\\n' \"$out\" ;; *) false ;; esac || { echo \"[careful] BLOCKED: the guard in .claude/hooks/ did not run or printed no decision (check-careful.sh missing, empty or broken). Restore .claude/hooks/ before anything else.\" >&2; exit 2; }",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "careful: checking for an edit to a guardrail file"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
